list.item:
Pg. 47 Shilling and Sixpence. PHILIP. ET. or Z.;
Period after Shilling and Sixpence should be comma, so changed to comma.
Shilling and Sixpence, PHILIP. ET. or Z.;

Pg. 63 ... obverse, same bust as. the silver, VICTORIA DEI GRATIA, and date;reverse, Sovereign, royal arms, as the Half-crown;
Phrase, “same bust as. The silver” should not have a period between as and the.
Changed to, ... same bust as the silver ...
